      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05505915492957746,
        "y0": 0.5126982758620691,
        "x1": 0.48419436619718315,
        "y1": 0.5256965517241379
      },
      "text": "(2) To pick and dress birds, particularly applied",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6598985915492958,
        "y0": 0.5220103448275862,
        "x1": 0.9331661971830986,
        "y1": 0.5330482758620689
      },
      "text": "Lydgate, MS. Sue. Antiq. 134, f. 23.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07610985915492957,
        "y0": 0.527851724137931,
        "x1": 0.2724647887323943,
        "y1": 0.5379758620689655
      },
      "text": "to dressing the heron.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6202225352112676,
        "y0": 0.5364155172413793,
        "x1": 0.8149605633802817,
        "y1": 0.5464344827586207
      },
      "text": "For thy perseynt charit^.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05424788732394366,
        "y0": 0.5380896551724137,
        "x1": 0.3364169014084507,
        "y1": 0.5520862068965517
      },
      "text": "PERNASO. Mount Parnassus.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6603014084507043,
        "y0": 0.5477810344827587,
        "x1": 0.933569014084507,
        "y1": 0.5588172413793103
      },
      "text": "Gowei; MS. Soc. Antiq. 134, f. 109.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05384507042253521,
        "y0": 0.5515120689655173,
        "x1": 0.4833830985915493,
        "y1": 0.5654534482758621
      },
      "text": "PERNEL. The pimpernel, a flower that always",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5020084507042253,
        "y0": 0.5585293103448277,
        "x1": 0.9331633802816902,
        "y1": 0.5729172413793103
      },
      "text": "PERSCRUTE. To search through. {Lat.) Used",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07610985915492957,
        "y0": 0.5671344827586207,
        "x1": 0.37731830985915493,
        "y1": 0.5785293103448276
      },
      "text": "shuts up its blossoms before rain.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5234647887323944,
        "y0": 0.5733775862068966,
        "x1": 0.8473436619718311,
        "y1": 0.5859413793103448
      },
      "text": "by Andrew Borde, Brit. Bibl. iv. 24.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07772957746478873,
        "y0": 0.5809310344827586,
        "x1": 0.4833830985915493,
        "y1": 0.6040741379310345
      },
      "text": "But these tender pemels must have one gown for the day, another for the night.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5016028169014084,
        "y0": 0.5863706896551724,
        "x1": 0.761912676056338,
        "y1": 0.5994431034482759
      },
      "text": "PERSE. Equality. (A.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5016028169014084,
        "y0": 0.5995155172413793,
        "x1": 0.7578760563380281,
        "y1": 0.6128965517241379
      },
      "text": "PERSEL. Parsley. Pegge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2724619718309859,
        "y0": 0.6062948275862069,
        "x1": 0.4829774647887324,
        "y1": 0.6159413793103448
      },
      "text": "- Pilkington'a Workt, p. 56.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5011971830985916,
        "y0": 0.6127172413793103,
        "x1": 0.8275042253521127,
        "y1": 0.6266586206896552
      },
      "text": "PERSEVER. To persevere. Shak.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05343943661971831,
        "y0": 0.6180827586206896,
        "x1": 0.39472676056338024,
        "y1": 0.6324603448275863
      },
      "text": "PERPEND. To consider attentively.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.6284224137931035,
        "x1": 0.852605633802817,
        "y1": 0.6398465517241378
      },
      "text": "Whether a daw sit, or whether a daw fly.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09351830985915492,
        "y0": 0.6332344827586207,
        "x1": 0.44938873239436616,
        "y1": 0.6433431034482759
      },
      "text": "You'll quickly know, if you do well perpend.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.6405655172413793,
        "x1": 0.878112676056338,
        "y1": 0.6752120689655172
      },
      "text": "Whether a daw stand, or whether a daw lye. Whether a daw crecpe, or whether a daw cry, In what case soever a daw persever,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09189859154929578,
        "y0": 0.6442258620689656,
        "x1": 0.42305915492957746,
        "y1": 0.6558431034482759
      },
      "text": "And observe rightly what's the proper end.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.26800845070422535,
        "y0": 0.658098275862069,
        "x1": 0.4821718309859155,
        "y1": 0.6671224137931034
      },
      "text": "Brome'a Songs, 1661, p. 182.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05303380281690141,
        "y0": 0.6698172413793104,
        "x1": 0.48217464788732395,
        "y1": 0.6966189655172413
      },
      "text": "PERPENDICLE. The plumb line of a quadrant. This word occurs in an old treatise on",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5202253521126761,
        "y0": 0.6748327586206897,
        "x1": 0.842487323943662,
        "y1": 0.6879051724137931
      },
      "text": "A daw is a daw, and a daw shall be ever.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7728478873239436,
        "y0": 0.6907431034482758,
        "x1": 0.9311408450704226,
        "y1": 0.6988758620689655
      },
      "text": "Tarlton'a Jeats, 1611.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07570704225352114,
        "y0": 0.6978258620689655,
        "x1": 0.3667887323943662,
        "y1": 0.7103155172413793
      },
      "text": "mensuration, in MS. Sloane213.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5007943661971831,
        "y0": 0.6994310344827586,
        "x1": 0.9331661971830986,
        "y1": 0.7668465517241378
      },
      "text": "PERSIAN-WHEEL. An engine invented to raise a quantity of water sufficient for overflowing lands, that border in the banks of rivers, where the streams lie so low, as to be incapable of doing it.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05263098591549296,
        "y0": 0.7089310344827586,
        "x1": 0.48217464788732395,
        "y1": 0.7372568965517241
      },
      "text": "PERPENTINE. A porcupine. \" Perpoynt, %*trix\" Pr. Parv. The formperpenfine occurs",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07084788732394366,
        "y0": 0.7389362068965517,
        "x1": 0.482169014084507,
        "y1": 0.7642310344827586
      },
      "text": "in Shakespeare, most incorrectly altered to porcupine by modern editors. It is the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07530140845070422,
        "y0": 0.7666431034482759,
        "x1": 0.23319436619718312,
        "y1": 0.7774672413793103
      },
      "text": "genuine old word.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5003887323943662,
        "y0": 0.7669206896551723,
        "x1": 0.8404563380281691,
        "y1": 0.7817362068965517
      },
      "text": "PERSON. A mask, or actor. {Lat.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05263098591549296,
        "y0": 0.7764155172413794,
        "x1": 0.48257183098591544,
        "y1": 0.792101724137931
      },
      "text": "PERPENT-STONE. A large stone reaching",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5003887323943662,
        "y0": 0.7801086206896551,
        "x1": 0.8339859154929578,
        "y1": 0.7945275862068966
      },
      "text": "PERSONABLE. Personally visible.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07449014084507043,
        "y0": 0.7929586206896552,
        "x1": 0.48379154929577467,
        "y1": 0.8448396551724138
      },
      "text": "through a wall so as to appear on both sides of it. Oxf. Gl. Arch. p. 280. In the North of England, a thin wall, the stones of which are built on the edge, is called a perpent.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5198197183098592,
        "y0": 0.7933637931034483,
        "x1": 0.930338028169014,
        "y1": 0.8291879310344827
      },
      "text": "My saied lorde of Winchester saied unto the kyng that the kyng his father, so visited with sitkenesse, was not personable. Hall, Henry VI. f. 13.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49998309859154927,
        "y0": 0.8311793103448276,
        "x1": 0.9311464788732395,
        "y1": 0.8468637931034483
      },
      "text": "PERSONE. A man. Generally, a man of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05303380281690141,
        "y0": 0.8435689655172414,
        "x1": 0.48176619718309854,
        "y1": 0.859253448275862
      },
      "text": "PERPETUANA. A kind of glossy cloth, gene-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.522656338028169,
        "y0": 0.8478431034482758,
        "x1": 0.8720338028169015,
        "y1": 0.85915
      },
      "text": "dignity, a parson or rector of a church.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49998309859154927,
        "y0": 0.8582741379310345,
        "x1": 0.7684056338028169,
        "y1": 0.8735224137931035
      },
      "text": "PERSORE. A piercing-iron.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07408732394366196,
        "y0": 0.8619103448275862,
        "x1": 0.2777267605633803,
        "y1": 0.8714568965517241
      },
      "text": "rally called everlasting.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.05263098591549296,
        "y0": 0.8717637931034483,
        "x1": 0.3748760563380281,
        "y1": 0.8862189655172414
      },
      "text": "PERPLANTED. Planted securely.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5781183098591549,
        "y0": 0.8766413793103448,
        "x1": 0.8092816901408452,
        "y1": 0.8979086206896552
      },
      "text": "3e, je, seyd the persore. That at I sey it shall be sure",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07651549295774648,
        "y0": 0.888501724137931,
        "x1": 0.4821718309859155,
        "y1": 0.9347431034482758
      },
      "text": "Requlrynge theim as his especiall truste and confidence was perplanted in the hope of their fidelite, that they would occurrc and mete hym by the vraye with all diligent preparacion.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5785239436619718,
        "y0": 0.8980155172413793,
        "x1": 0.8412676056338028,
        "y1": 0.9333172413793104
      },
      "text": "Whi chyd je iche one with other ? Wote 56 wele I ame jour brother ! Therefore none contrary me.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5797380281690141,
        "y0": 0.9348655172413793,
        "x1": 0.9299295774647888,
        "y1": 0.945551724137931
      },
      "text": "Fore as I sey so schall it be. MS.Ashmole Cl>",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3068732394366197,
        "y0": 0.9362155172413793,
        "x1": 0.48014366197183095,
        "y1": 0.9460913793103448
      },
      "text": "Hall, Richard lU. f. 27.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
  ],
